# {{ brand }} logo package

Built {{ built }} by logo-maker. To regenerate it, copy the files in `source/` back: `concept.py`, `params.json`, `tokens.json` and `rationale.md` into `brands/{{ slug }}/final/`, and `brand.json` and `strategy.json` into `brands/{{ slug }}/` beside it. Then run `uv run logomaker concept run {{ slug }} final` (packaging needs a passing audit of the final mark) and `uv run logomaker package build {{ slug }}`; `package build` reads `final/`, never `source/`.

Preview the `reverse` and `white` PNGs on a dark background; they are transparent. CMYK values in the PDFs, EPS files and `tokens.json` are a naive conversion; confirm with your printer before a press run.

